      "text": "# Morrow Works — fictional company\n\nMorrow Works\n\nWe design modular objects for calmer desks. This company, its people, products and policies are authored fiction for the Intakelet demo.\n\nMade for small workspaces\n\nOur sample range contains Loop Stand and Desk Tray. Both use replaceable components.\n",
